wepoll v1.5.8 (https://github.com/piscisaureus/wepoll, tag v1.5.8, dist build), BSD-2-Clause: see wepoll.LICENSE.
Used by c/win32.c for readiness (tcp_poll_*) on Windows.

One change, marked "libtcp:" in sock__afd_events_to_epoll_events: AFD_POLL_ABORT (a reset)
reports IN, OUT, ERR, HUP and RDHUP as Linux does, not HUP alone. wepoll masks the result by
the registration's events as before, so a read-only registration still sees no OUT.
